<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\荒田バギー夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―In the evening, we arrived at Arata Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Two of the residents, <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro Niimura-san</STYLE> and Shirozaki-san, had come to meet us in buggies.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, was it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Thanks for coming all this way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Nice to meet you. I'm Erina Goto. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm... so sorry for your loss."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, how come </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> got permission to attend too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I heard </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got attacked by the culprit too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Couldn't very well treat her like an outsider, is what </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Huh, so that's the kind of settlement it is. That's why <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> tried to flee here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\新村本家庭夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―We arrived at the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were almost no cherry trees around here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only the old cherry tree at the Niimura main house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was old, but the strength of its flowers in full bloom was something to behold.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything happens, this cherry tree will probably tell me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家2階夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went into the room we were shown to with <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and put down my things.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time, I'm here for <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu Niimura's</STYLE> funeral.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to pretend to grieve at least a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, are you okay? You look really tired."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... I'm fine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly... what a pain...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... you must be worn out, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could she be a relative of <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Both her eyes were blue, and she had a truly mysterious air.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\春花茅萱抱き合う.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Uuu... </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... there, there, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. That must have been hard."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was crying into <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> chest.<PG>
Even seeing the two of them like that, I felt nothing in particular.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who had died was the person who killed <STYLE ID="7">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="8">her father</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was someone who was bound to die.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, was it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, yes. I'm, um, very sorry for your..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was getting sick of these formal greetings.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> came here for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. She's my cute </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">junior</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... thank you for always looking after </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. And thanks for coming all this way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh no, it's nothing that big..."</STYLE><PG>
Even so, my eyes still itched.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like to take them out soon.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, time to get changed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What had been prepared for us was a Noh mask and red robes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This outfit was the same as <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu Niimura's</STYLE> that time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But with this, I'd be free of the itching in my eyes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家2階夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'm going to the bathroom. I'll change there while I'm at it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Got it. I'll be waiting at the front door."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\五島鏡横.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I faced the mirror over the sink.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They're a little bloodshot...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On day 3 of contact lenses, I'm still not used to them.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\五島鏡正面.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My eyes, with the colored contacts taken out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since that business on April 8, something strange had happened to those eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After watching <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> go, I looked in the mirror and was shocked.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\緑目.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
One of my eyes had turned green.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I have a rough idea of what caused it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\五島家洗面所.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Right after looking in the mirror, I helped myself to <STYLE ID="9">Sis's</STYLE> disposable colored contacts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These contacts make the irises look bigger, but on me, with my naturally big irises, they don't make much difference.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Conveniently, the green part is hidden.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\緑目.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\五島鏡正面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
To begin with, eye color is determined by the ratio of melanin in the iris.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Basically, it's supposed to stay the same for life, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would it have been better to get it checked at a hospital?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\夏菜鏡.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n109\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n109\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
............!!??
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Who? <STYLE ID="10">This kid</STYLE>...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A child even smaller than me, suddenly reflected in the mirror.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家洗面所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Are you </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Y-yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Ha! I knew it! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　I'm </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> cousin, Kana Niimura! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　Nice to meet you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah... yeah, nice to meet you..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">This kid</STYLE> had just one green eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The other one was blue, the same as <STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee's</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that <STYLE ID="10">this kid</STYLE> is the same as me―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Huh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> eye color..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, don't look! This is an eye disease, and I might lose my sight from it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm still too scared, so I haven't told anyone... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Keep it a secret from everyone...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"What!? That's terrible! I won't tell anyone! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　When you get back to Motoki-cho, make sure you go to the hospital!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay..."</STYLE><PG>
On the spur of the moment, I'd told a clumsy lie.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though maybe it really is a disease...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, right? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, were you born with that eye color?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Yep, that's right! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">My sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> used to have one green eye too, but now both of them are blue!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see. That's unusual..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anyway, I'd sworn <STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE> to silence about my eye color, so it should be fine.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\春花死神透明.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"You took a long time. You okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, I was just a little tired."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry for dragging you all the way out here... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, really, thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What a pain...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会所夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―At the meeting hall, people were coming and going on and off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently today wasn't the funeral but the day that counted as the wake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed the return of the body had taken a while because of the autopsy and such, so the wake was being held 3 days after the death.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, isn't a wake something everyone does together?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\春花死神透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"At the wake, you just look at the face of the deceased and pray."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
More than a wake, that's really a condolence call...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Inside, people in Noh masks and red robes, just like us, were crowded in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On a platform at the front lay a Noh mask and red robes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Inside those red robes, a bulge like a person.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> in there?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She burned to death, so they must have covered her like that so she can't be seen.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what are we supposed to do here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\サード\春花死神透明.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Huh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, where's the falsificaso?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's that?<PG>
