{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... this time it was too sudden, so we couldn't get any ready. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Apparently they can have it ready for tomorrow's funeral, though... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Right now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> is making it, I hear."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That can't be helped... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm gonna stay here and help for a while, so head back ahead of me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You must be tired, so get some rest."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
