{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'm going to help out a bit longer too, so go back with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
